AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002000> "a relation between a 2D immaterial entity (the boundary) and a material entity, in which the boundary delimits the material entity"@en)
