AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002170> "a is connected to b if and only if a and b are discrete structure, and there exists some connecting structure c, such that c connects a and b")
