# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002073> (transitional myocyte)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FMA:67142") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:tfm") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002073> "Specialized cardiac myocyte which is in the internodal tract and atrioventricular node. The cell is more slender than ordinary atrial myocytes and has more myofibrils than nodal myocytes.")
