# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002573> (Schwann cell)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:tfm") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:16807057") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002573> "A glial cell that myelinates or ensheathes axons in the peripheral nervous system.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002573> <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1980-3228>)
