AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:16807057") rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002573> "A myelinating Schwann cell wraps around a single axon. Myelination occurs in larger diameter axons, while a process called ensheathment occurs on smaller diameter axons in which a single cell wraps around multiple small, unmyelinated axons separating them with a thin layer of cytoplasm. The structure formed is called a Remak bundle.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002573> "Schwann cell")
