# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002381> (food product by organism)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002381> "A food product consisting of food material derived primarily from a single organism."@en)
