AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03400105> "sauce, condiment, dressing or gravy"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03400105> "dressing, condiment, gravy or sauce (us cfr)"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03400105> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401270>)

