AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412091> "pumpkin, squash or gourd"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412091> "squash, gourd or pumpkin plant"@en)
