AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0006210> "dermatogen cell (related)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0006210> "A protoderm may or may not arise from independent initial cells (PO:0004011). Some researchers also refer to it as an epidermis in a  meristematic state.")
