AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0008028> "生殖シュート頂端 分裂組織 (Japanese, exact)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0008028> "reproductive shoot apical meristem")
