# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0010911> (ossicle)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PSPUB:0000169") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "VSAO:0000132") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0010911> "Skeletal element that is often isolated, small, and variable in composition.")
