AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0013631> "Sesamoids are often endochondral replacement elements and in addition to bone tissue, may also be composed of articular cartilage, fibrocartilage, hyaline cartilage, and calcified cartilage.")
